{
  "_comment": [
    "Fuigo ships FluxRouter lanes, not vendor model ids. One sk-flux- key reaches",
    "Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, DeepSeek, Moonshot and the rest.",
    "",
    "CONTEXT WINDOW POLICY — read before editing a context_window.",
    "FluxRouter's /v1/models and its x-flux-model-window header BOTH over-report.",
    "Verified 2026-09-01: flux-pinned-claude-opus-5 advertises max_input_tokens",
    "1000000 when the real Claude Opus window is 200000, and 29 of 79 catalogue",
    "entries omit the field entirely. A `flux-auto` request routed to qwen-plus,",
    "whose real window is 129024 -- against Fuigo's 200000 default for unknown",
    "models. That gap is why auto-compaction never fires and a session can reach",
    "17M cumulative input tokens (Wayland Core #255).",
    "",
    "So: never copy an advertised window in here. Under-claiming costs one extra",
    "compaction; over-claiming costs the whole session. Floor at 128000 for any",
    "routed lane and for any model whose true window we cannot corroborate.",
    "A user who knows better raises it per-model in config.toml."
  ],
  "default": "flux-auto",
  "web_search": "flux-fast",
  "image_description": "flux-fast",
  "session_summary": "flux-fast",
